      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Cluster topology** from one node's view (`GET /cluster/topology` on the Bondy admin listener, via the **Infinity** datasource). Nodes are cluster members \u2014 the green/red ring is health (connected + no alarms); edges are live Partisan connections, with **average heartbeat RTT** and connection count. Point the query URL at the admin port of the node whose view you want (dev: `:18081`/`:18181`/`:18281`).\n\n> \u26a0\ufe0f The Infinity node-graph query *format* (`nodegraph-nodes`/`nodegraph-edges`) and column inference should be confirmed once in a live Grafana; the endpoint already emits the exact Node Graph field names, so no column remapping should be needed."
      }
